      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Compare the two squares",
      "body": "<p>Expand <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mi>v</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mi>v</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></math>, or factor their difference; then substitute the expressions for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow></math>.</p>",
